sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant FE as React 18
  participant BE as Go 1.23
  participant MEM as In-Memory Repo

  User->>FE: ingresa valor + unidades
  FE->>BE: POST /convert
  BE->>BE: ConvertTemperature
  BE->>MEM: Save(ConversionRecord)
  MEM-->>BE: ok
  BE-->>FE: result
  FE-->>User: resultado + historial

  User->>FE: recarga historial
  FE->>BE: GET /history
  BE->>MEM: FindAll()
  MEM-->>BE: records
  BE-->>FE: JSON array
  FE-->>User: historial renderizado
